{
  "summary": "Implement the Space Fractions sixth-grade fraction-learning microservices as a runnable Node.js 22+ repository. A browser gateway (port 3000) fronts game/question/user/admin services backed by PostgreSQL (source of truth), Redis (cache), RabbitMQ (score events), Elasticsearch (question search), Keycloak (OIDC) and Prometheus (metrics). Exact rational fraction arithmetic, per-game owner authorization, transactional score deduplication, idempotent migrations/seeds, and an independent REST acceptance contract (plus original GET /play compatibility) are implemented. Reference-only cloud/deployment configs are labelled and not claimed validated.",
